# CLAUDE.md

> Claude Code specific configuration | Extends [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)

## Model Preferences

```yaml
default: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
complex_tasks: claude-opus-4-20250514
quick_tasks: claude-haiku
```

## Claude Code Commands

```bash
# Start session with context
claude "Read @.ai/README.md and @.specs/{service}/index.md"

# Implementation with spec check
claude "Implement {feature} - check spec first per .ai/workflows/implementation.md"

# Code review
claude "Review changes in this PR per .ai/workflows/review.md"
```

## Prompt Patterns

### Starting Work
```
@.ai/README.md Read project context.
@.specs/{service}/index.md Check current tasks.
```

### Implementation Request
```
Implement {feature}.
- Follow .ai/workflows/implementation.md
- If no spec exists, create SDD first
```

### Problem Resolution
```
Error: {error message}
- Follow .ai/workflows/incident.md
- Attempt self-resolution before asking
```

## MCP Servers (Optional)

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "filesystem": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@anthropic/mcp-server-filesystem", "/path/to/project"]
    }
  }
}
```

## Token Optimization

| Context | Max Tokens | Strategy |
|---------|------------|----------|
| Initial | Read .ai/README.md only | Minimal start |
| Working | Add .specs/{service}/index.md | On-demand |
| Deep dive | Add specific spec files | As needed |

## Custom Instructions

Add any project-specific Claude instructions here:

```
# Example: Always use Korean for comments
- Write code comments in Korean
- Use English for variable/function names
```
